= The Comisión de Responsabilidades

The Cortes' Commission of Responsibilities has been investigating the causes of the 1921 disaster at Annual, where the Army of Africa suffered a catastrophic defeat that cost thousands of lives, and the culpability of the old monarchy and the Primo de Rivera dictatorship that followed it. So far, it has faced fierce resistance from the officer corps and the monarchist right - up to the exiled King Alfonso XIII himself.

- @restart: Press the inquiry forward.
- @root: Do nothing.
