@restart
on-arrival: war_guilt += 1

What is the goal of this commission?

- @pure_history: To provide a historical record of the events at Annual.
- @rewrite: To fix responsibility on the King and the generals, not the scapegoats they blamed at the time.

@pure_history
on-arrival: president_angry -= 5

The history is being compiled, as it always has been.

@rewrite
on-arrival: pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 5*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 5*(1-dissent); coup_progress += 1; izq_rep_relation += 1; president_angry += 10

Fixing responsibility on Alfonso XIII and the generals who commanded at Annual, rather than the junior officers and colonial troops blamed at the time, would do a great deal to discredit the old order in the public eye. This is precisely why it is resisted by the officer corps at every step.
